  </section>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div></div></div></section><section class=\"principles-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">设计原则 · Principles</div><div class=\"usage-box use principles-box\"><ul><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\"><b>粗描边建立直接轮廓</b>：按钮、卡片和输入框可以共用同一尺度，粗细按尺寸与主题调整</div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\"><b>无模糊硬阴影</b>：用纯色位移制造拼贴感，偏移量不应盖住相邻内容</div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\"><b>高对比配色有主次</b>：荧光色是常见示例，也可以用低饱和色；文字对比和状态含义仍要清楚</div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\"><b>大号粗体承担海报感</b>：字重和紧排需要根据字体能力、中英文和换行测试</div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\"><b>交互状态覆盖鼠标、键盘和触屏</b>：悬停可移动阴影，按下与焦点也要有明确反馈</div></li></ul></div></section><div class=\"usage-grid\"><div class=\"usage-box use\"><h3><span class=\"mark\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m5 12.5 4.2 4.2L19 7\"></path></svg></span>什么时候用</h3><ul><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">独立产品官网，需要鲜明而直接的品牌态度</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-win\" style=\"text-align:left;background:#ffdd00;border:2.5px solid #000\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:900;color:#000\">别想了，先上线。</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#000;display:block;margin-top:3px\">独立开发者的不服和直给</span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">数字商品页面，用高对比突出内容和价格</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-row\"><span style=\"background:#ff90e8;border:2.5px solid #000;border-radius:4px;padding:4px 9px;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;color:#000;box-shadow:3px 3px 0 #000\">电子书 ¥29</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">Gumroad 式数字商品</span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">活动和黑客松页面，需要较强参与感</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-row\"><span style=\"background:#90e8ff;border:2.5px solid #000;padding:3px 9px;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;color:#000\">黑客松 2026</span><span style=\"background:#ffdd00;border:2.5px solid #000;padding:3px 9px;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;color:#000\">48 小时</span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">局部表达反精致方向，建立视觉辨识度</div><div class=\"mk \"><span style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:900;color:#000;border-bottom:3px solid #ff90e8\">「反精致」也是一种态度</span></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"usage-box dont\"><h3><span class=\"mark\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7l10 10M17 7 7 17\"></path></svg></span>什么时候不用</h3><ul><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">金融和医疗核心流程只追求视觉冲击</div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"mk-win\" style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:var(--text-2)\">银行 App（黑粗边 + 荧光粉）</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">金融医疗要信任感，粗野显得不靠谱</span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">企业工具把每个区域都做成高强度海报</div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"mk-win\" style=\"text-align:left\"><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:90%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:70%\"></i><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">企业工具需先保证可信度、扫描效率和状态清晰</span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">正式办事页面让装饰压过信息和操作</div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"mk-win\" style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:var(--text-2)\">政务办事大厅（撞色版）</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">正式服务场景应优先庄重、稳定和易操作</span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">全站持续使用撞色，造成长期视觉疲劳</div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"mk-row\"><span style=\"width:20px;height:20px;border:2px solid #000;background:#ff90e8\"></span><span style=\"width:20px;height:20px;border:2px solid #000;background:#ffdd00\"></span><span style=\"width:20px;height:20px;border:2px solid #000;background:#90e8ff\"></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">× N 页</span></div></div></li></ul></div></div><section><div class=\"section-title\">组成结构 · Anatomy</div><div class=\"anat-wrap\"><div class=\"anat-stage\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\">\n      <span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"border\"><span class=\"style-brutalism-chip\"><i style=\"background:#fff;border:3px solid #000;border-radius:3px\"></i>纯黑描边 2-3px</span></span>\n      <span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"shadow\"><span class=\"style-brutalism-chip\"><i style=\"background:#fff;border:2.5px solid #000;box-shadow:4px 4px 0 #000\"></i>硬阴影</span></span>\n      <span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"color\"><span class=\"style-brutalism-chip\"><i style=\"background:linear-gradient(90deg,#ff90e8 33%,#ffdd00 33%,#ffdd00 66%,#90e8ff 66%)\"></i>高饱和撞色</span></span>\n      <span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"type\"><span class=\"style-brutalism-chip\"><b style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:900;color:#000\">Aa</b>900 粗黑标题</span></span>\n      <span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"press\"><span class=\"style-brutalism-chip\"><i style=\"background:#ff90e8;border:2.5px solid #000;box-shadow:2px 2px 0 #000\"></i>按压位移</span></span>\n    </span></div><div class=\"anat-parts\"><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"border\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">1</span><span class=\"pn\">粗描边</span><span class=\"pe\">Border</span></button><span class=\"pd\">用统一尺度建立剪纸般轮廓，颜色和粗细按主题与组件尺寸调整</span></div><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"shadow\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">2</span><span class=\"pn\">硬阴影</span><span class=\"pe\">Hard Shadow</span></button><span class=\"pd\">无模糊纯色位移形成拼贴感，偏移量按空间和控件大小设定</span></div><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"color\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">3</span><span class=\"pn\">高对比配色</span><span class=\"pe\">Colors</span></button><span class=\"pd\">示例用荧光粉、明黄和亮蓝；实际色板要有主次并通过对比测试</span></div><div cla